<title>SOUTH AFRICA: CRICKET-SOUTH AFRICA 209 AND 137-6, AUSTRALIA 108.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-SOUTH AFRICA 209 AND 137-6, AUSTRALIA 108.</headline>
<dateline>PORT ELIZABETH 1997-03-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Africa were 137 for six in their second innings, an overall lead of 238, at lunch on the third day of the second test against Australia on Sunday.</p>
<p>Scores: South Africa 209 and 137-6, Australia 108</p>
</text>
